{"id":"the-supreme-evoker","slug":"the-supreme-evoker","name":"至尊唤魔者","english":"The Supreme Evoker","kind":"enemy","categoryKey":"enemies","dbKind":"reference","image":"./images/database/renders-thumb-the-supreme-evoker.png","description":"","parameters":[["基础生命","1,000"],["基础伤害","15"],["韧性","650"],["灵魂","200"],["最高单次伤害","15"],["速度","380"]],"tables":[{"title":"Where you fight it","columns":["WHEN","QUEST","WHERE"],"rows":[["Story quest","最终魂战","深暗之域"],["Rematch","最终魂战：返场","深暗之域"]]},{"title":"Moves","columns":["移动","效果","基础伤害","类型"],"rows":[["Enchanted projectiles","It thrusts out one hand、then the other、and each one releases a fan of orbs spread across 80 degrees. The orbs fly straight at a tenth of a Pillager arrow's speed、break on walls、so step through the gaps or put cover between you.","8",""],["Fang trap","It only casts this when you're close. The regular Evoker's trap-summon sound plays、and after a slow wind-up seven fangs erupt in a ring around it; each hits for 15、knocks you back、applies Slowed、so roll out of the ring as soon as you hear the cue.","15",""],["Protective bubble","A bubble forms around it、takes every hit meant for the Evoker until it has absorbed 50 damage (up to 1.75 times that with four players). A new bubble can't go up until 23 秒onds after the last one did、so popping it fast buys a longer window on the boss.","",""],["Summon illagers","Between 95%、60% health it calls in a squad of 1-2 Pillagers、2-6 Vindicators、up to 2 Royal Guards、sometimes an Enchanter、with no more than six alive from this spell. It can recast every 26 秒onds.","",""],["Summon soul vex","Below 60% health the squad is replaced by a bigger wave: four Vex、1-2 Pillagers、1-2 Royal Guards、an Enchanter、with up to 12 alive at once. It can recast every 32 秒onds.","",""],["Teleport retreat","Only while its bubble is down、it's above 15% health、it fades out、reappears at a random flee point in the arena、at most once every 15 秒onds. It's untargetable、invulnerable for about half a 秒ond as it vanishes.","",""],["Teleport construct","Once its health drops below 15%、it teleports to the center of the arena a single time. It has already stopped chasing you at 25%、no longer retreats、so it finishes the fight from that spot.","",""]]},{"title":"原生属性（定义值）","native":true,"note":"解包表中的直接定义值；继承、难度与战力缩放另行计算。","columns":["定义","参数","数值"],"rows":[["至尊唤魔者","韧性","650"],["至尊唤魔者","生命","1000"],["至尊唤魔者","韧性恢复延迟","3"],["至尊唤魔者","韧性恢复速度","5"],["至尊唤魔者","移动速度","380"]]},{"title":"原生能力参数","native":true,"note":"保留能力的定义值与覆盖操作；未翻译的内部字段保留原名。","columns":["定义","能力","参数","数值","操作"],"rows":[["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","最大目标距离","0","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","最小目标距离","0","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","触发权重","100","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","冷却时间","26","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","激活期间允许再次触发","否","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","bSpawnFromLootTable","否","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","bIncludeAreaLootTable","否","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","bUseMobWaves","是","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","开始延迟","0.6","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","预警延迟","0","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","生成间隔","0","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","最少生成数","1","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","最多生成数","1","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","bTrackPopulation","是","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","最大存活数量","6","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","bDestroyAtWorldReset","否","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","RotateImage","否","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","ImageRotateOffset","90","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","bTraceToFloor","是","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","AsyncTraceLengthOverride","-1","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","生成高度偏移","0","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","生成方向偏移","0","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","bRandomiseSpawnDirection","是","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","bRandomRadius","是","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","最小半径","200","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","最大半径","900","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","bRoundCalculatedPositionToGrid","否","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","bCheckIfItemPowerShouldBeApplied","否","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","结束延迟","0","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","bSuicideOnEnd","否","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","RunAnimationIndependent","否","定义值"],["至尊唤魔者","召唤灾厄村民","bRandomiseAIPrimaryTargetOnSp